<title>SWEDEN: Sandvik bids 827 mln Skr for part of Kanthal.</title>
<headline>Sandvik bids 827 mln Skr for part of Kanthal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish steel group Sandvik said on Tuesday it has bid 827 million crowns ($106.6 million) for all of investment group Trustor's shares in machinery group Kanthal.</p>
<p>($ = 7.757 Swedish Crowns)</p>
</text>
